<h2>Verify Your Email Address</h2>
<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
<p>Thank you for signing up with iFormat. Please use the following 6-digit verification code to complete your registration:</p>

<div style="margin: 28px 0; text-align: center;">
  <span style="display: inline-block; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #0A54B1; background: #f0f7ff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px dashed #0A54B1;">
    <%= code %>
  </span>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #475569;">This code is valid for <strong>10 minutes</strong>. If you did not request this verification code, please ignore this email.</p>
